--- !u!114 &775364510
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 775364508}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4fa915321fb82c3409e875adb8383ed9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  languageData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eb0c907e1bf9b3e4b9c51bdece2e7eb6, type: 2}
  changeFontOnly: 0
  fontWithTexture: 0
  simpleFont: 1
  englishText: "\tNina is the youngest exorcist in the group and proudly the owner
    of her 9 precious lives. If there's one thing she's not good at, it's handling
    money. As soon as something silly appears to buy, she starts spending everything
    she has and even what she doesn't have!\r\n\r\n\tSociability is not exactly her
    strong suit. She has no patience for pretending to be nice to people she doesn't
    like. At least she's honest...\r\n\r\n\tAnd never, I mean never, try to pet her
    belly. It's an invitation to an exciting journey into the world of pain!"
  chineseText: "\u59AE\u5A1C\u662F\u961F\u4F0D\u91CC\u6700\u5E74\u8F7B\u7684\u6076\u9B54\u730E\u4EBA\uFF0C\u5979\u5F15\u4EE5\u4E3A\u8C6A\u7684\u4E5D\u6761\u547D\u95EA\u95EA\u53D1\u5149\u3002\u5979\u552F\u4E00\u505A\u4E0D\u6765\u7684\u4E8B\uFF0C\u5C31\u662F\u7BA1\u4F4F\u8377\u5305\u3002\u4E0D\u7BA1\u78B0\u89C1\u4EC0\u4E48\u8822\u4E1C\u897F\uFF0C\u53EA\u8981\u80FD\u4E70\u4E0B\uFF0C\u5979\u5C31\u4F1A\u5F00\u59CB\u82B1\u94B1\uFF0C\u751A\u81F3\u82B1\u6389\u4E0D\u5C5E\u4E8E\u5979\u7684\u94B1!\n\n\u4FDD\u6301\u4EBA\u9645\u5173\u7CFB\u4E5F\u4E0D\u662F\u5979\u7684\u5F3A\u9879\u3002\u5728\u8BA8\u538C\u7684\u5BB6\u4F19\u9762\u524D\uFF0C\u5979\u6CA1\u8010\u5FC3\u4FDD\u6301\u548C\u989C\u60A6\u8272\u3002\u4E0D\u8FC7\u81F3\u5C11\uFF0C\u5979\u5F85\u4EBA\u5766\u8BDA\u3002\n\n\u800C\u4E14\uFF0C\u5343\u4E07\u4E0D\u8981\u5C1D\u8BD5\u629A\u6478\u5979\u7684\u809A\u5B50\u3002\u90A3\u4F1A\u8BA9\u4F60\u8E0F\u4E0A\u4E00\u6BB5\u4EE4\u4EBA\u5174\u594B\uFF0C\u4F46\u82E6\u75DB\u4E07\u5206\u7684\u65C5\u7A0B!"
  portugueseText: "\tNina \xE9 a exorcista mais jovem do grupo e orgulhosa propriet\xE1ria
    de suas 9 preciosas vidas. Se tem algo em que ela n\xE3o \xE9 boa \xE9 com dinheiro.
    \xC9 s\xF3 aparecer uma besteirinha para comprar que ela j\xE1 sai gastando tudo
    o que tem e o que n\xE3o tem tamb\xE9m!\r\n\r\n\tSociabilidade n\xE3o \xE9 exatamente
    o forte dela. Ela n\xE3o tem paci\xEAncia para fingir ser legal perto de quem
    ela n\xE3o gosta. Pelo menos ela \xE9 sincera\u2026\r\n\r\n\tE, ah, nunca, mas
    nunca mesmo, tente fazer carinho na barriga dela. \xC9 um convite para um passeio
    emocionante no mundo da dor! \r"
  spanishText: "Nina es la exorcista m\xE1s joven del grupo y orgullosa due\xF1a
    de sus 9 preciosas vidas. Si hay algo en lo que no es buena, es en manejar dinero.
    Tan pronto como aparece algo tonto para comprar, comienza a gastar todo lo que
    tiene e incluso lo que no tiene. La sociabilidad no es precisamente su punto
    fuerte. No tiene paciencia para pretender ser amable con personas a las que no
    les gusta. Al menos es honesta... Y nunca, quiero decir nunca, intentes acariciarle
    el vientre. Es una invitaci\xF3n a un emocionante viaje al mundo del dolor!"
--- !u!114 &775364511
