  m_text: 'Nina is the youngest exorcist in the group and proudly the owner of her
    9 precious lives. If there''s one thing she''s not good at, it''s handling money.
    As soon as something silly appears to buy, she starts spending everything she
    has and even what she doesn''t have!



    Sociability is not exactly her strong
    suit. She has no patience for pretending to be nice to people she doesn''t like.
    At least she''s honest...



    And never, I mean never, try to pet her belly.
    It''s an invitation to an exciting journey into the world of pain!'
