--- !u!114 &1879946313
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1879946311}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4fa915321fb82c3409e875adb8383ed9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  languageData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eb0c907e1bf9b3e4b9c51bdece2e7eb6, type: 2}
  changeFontOnly: 0
  fontWithTexture: 0
  simpleFont: 1
  englishText: "\tHanba has died so many times that it's as if heaven and hell are
    playing a game of tennis with him, and neither of them wants to accept him. Forced
    to remain on Earth, he can't stand dying anymore and always says that if he dies
    again, he'll quit this exorcist life and let Azaus figure it out on his own.
    \n\n\tHe doesn't have much going on in his head, which makes conversations with
    him a true test of boredom resistance. And don't use irony with him. He just
    doesn't get it. But other than that, he's a good guy."
  chineseText: "\u97E9\u5DF4\u5DF2\u7ECF\u6B7B\u8FC7\u90A3\u4E48\u591A\u6B21\uFF0C\u5C31\u597D\u50CF\u5929\u5802\u548C\u5730\u72F1\u5728\u7528\u4ED6\u6253\u4E00\u573A\u7F51\u7403\u6BD4\u8D5B\uFF0C\u4F46\u4E24\u8005\u90FD\u4E0D\u613F\u610F\u63A5\u7EB3\u4ED6\u3002\u4ED6\u88AB\u8FEB\u7559\u5728\u5730\u7403\u4E0A\uFF0C\u4ED6\u518D\u4E5F\u53D7\u4E0D\u4E86\u6B7B\u4EA1\uFF0C\u5E76\u4E14\u603B\u662F\u8BF4\u5982\u679C\u4ED6\u53C8\u6B7B\u4E00\u6B21\u7684\u8BDD\uFF0C\u4ED6\u5C31\u4F1A\u653E\u5F03\u8FD9\u4E2A\u6076\u9B54\u730E\u4EBA\u7684\u751F\u6D3B\uFF0C\u8BA9\u963F\u624E\u65AF\u81EA\u5DF1\u89E3\u51B3\u3002\n\n\u4ED6\u7684\u5934\u8111\u7A7A\u7A7A\u7684\uFF0C\u6CA1\u88C5\u4EC0\u4E48\u4E8B\u60C5\u3002\u6240\u4EE5\u548C\u4ED6\u804A\u5929\uFF0C\u662F\u4E00\u573A\u68C0\u9A8C\u4EBA\u80FD\u5426\u62B5\u6297\u6781\u7AEF\u65E0\u804A\u7684\u8003\u9A8C\u3002\u8FD8\u6709\uFF0C\u6CA1\u5FC5\u8981\u5632\u8BBD\u4ED6\u3002\u4ED6\u5C31\u662F\u641E\u4E0D\u660E\u767D\u5F88\u591A\u4E8B\u3002\u4E0D\u8FC7\u561B\uFF0C\u4ED6\u662F\u4E2A\u597D\u4EBA\u3002"
  portugueseText: "\tHanba j\xE1 morreu tantas vezes que \xE9 como se o c\xE9u e
    o inferno estivessem jogando uma partida de t\xEAnis com ele e nenhum dos dois
    quisesse aceit\xE1-lo. For\xE7ado a permanecer na terra, ele n\xE3o aguenta mais
    morrer e sempre diz que se morrer de novo vai largar essa vida de exorcista e
    Azaus que se vire sozinho. \r\n\r\n\tEle n\xE3o tem muita coisa na cabe\xE7a,
    o que torna as conversas com ele um verdadeiro teste de resist\xEAncia ao t\xE9dio.
    E n\xE3o use ironia com ele. Ele n\xE3o entende. Mas tirando isso ele \xE9 gente
    boa. \r\n"
  spanishText: "Hanba ha muerto tantas veces que parece como si el cielo y el infierno
    estuvieran jugando al tenis con \xE9l, y ninguno de los dos quiere aceptarlo.
    Obligado a permanecer en la Tierra, ya no soporta morir y siempre dice que si
    muere de nuevo, abandonar\xE1 esta vida de exorcista y dejar\xE1 que Azaus se
    las arregle solo. No tiene mucho en la cabeza, lo que hace que las conversaciones
    con \xE9l sean una verdadera prueba de resistencia al aburrimiento. Y no uses
    iron\xEDa con \xE9l. Simplemente no lo entiende. Pero aparte de eso, es un buen
    tipo."
--- !u!114 &1879946314
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1879946311}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\"Hanba has died so many times that it's as if heaven and hell are playing
    a game of tennis with him, and neither of them wants to accept him. Forced to
    remain on Earth, he can't stand dying anymore and always says that if he dies
    again, he'll quit this exorcist life and let Azaus figure it out on his own.
    \n\nHe doesn't have much going on in his head, which makes conversations with
    him a true test of boredom resistance. And don't use irony with him. He just
    doesn't get it. But other than that, he's a good guy.\""
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2d1bb8a38d39589449b7b49614835784, type: 2}
